---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { journal } from '../lib/journal';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Submit a Paper"
  subtitle="Original research, case studies, technical notes, and reviews are welcome."
  description="How to submit your manuscript to IJATS, including required components and the peer-review process."
>
  <p>
    The <strong>{journal.name} ({journal.shortName})</strong> welcomes original
    research papers, case studies, technical notes, and review articles from
    researchers and practitioners worldwide.
  </p>

  <h2>Submission Instructions</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Manuscripts must be prepared in <strong>English</strong> and follow IJATS formatting guidelines.</li>
    <li>All submissions must be <strong>original</strong> and <strong>unpublished</strong>, and not under consideration elsewhere.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Please include the following components:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Title Page (title, authors, affiliations, contact email)</li>
    <li>Abstract (200–300 words)</li>
    <li>Keywords (3–6 relevant terms)</li>
    <li>Main Manuscript Body (Introduction, Methods, Results, Discussion, Conclusion)</li>
    <li>References (standard citation format)</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Submit your manuscript as a <strong>PDF or Word document</strong> by email to
    <a href={`mailto:${journal.email.submissions}?subject=IJATS%20Submission`}>{journal.email.submissions}</a>.
    Please include <strong>"IJATS Submission"</strong> in the subject line.
  </p>

  <h2>Peer Review Process</h2>
  <p>
    All submissions undergo a rigorous <strong>double-blind peer review</strong> by
    independent experts, selected on the basis of subject expertise. Evaluation
    focuses on originality, significance, quality, and relevance.
  </p>

  <h2>Open Access &amp; Fees</h2>
  <p>
    IJATS is an <strong>open-access journal</strong>. For the inaugural issues,
    there are <strong>no Article Processing Charges (APCs)</strong>.
  </p>

  <h2>Need Assistance?</h2>
  <p>
    If you encounter any issues during submission, please
    <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
